  "authority": "Standing owner-approved sequential-remediation default uses serial current-runtime smoke and an exact-base assessment for bounded rules repairs. Detailed comparisons remain mandatory for deliberate performance changes or demonstrated serious regressions. This scope recognizes only these exact S25 file/owner before/after hashes, category rule_semantics and explicit existing sensitive operations; no original mapping/ceiling/history/work/cache check or final gate is changed.",
